{"steam_appid":4235160,"steam_name":"Traders Life Simulator","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4235160/342317459/990977f2ee073907f04239333e19454b61e3060c/1768951865/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1769015260","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257268594/c767dce870ae82edbc22a75ebb2d7a5659ebdfcc/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1769015260","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235160/982a88a03d0fe1abfc472d6d064bd78d571a7dad/ss_982a88a03d0fe1abfc472d6d064bd78d571a7dad.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785763768","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235160/1e448374c7a535270c13acbdb55ed6b18a82eefb/ss_1e448374c7a535270c13acbdb55ed6b18a82eefb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785763768","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235160/c46cf58b44c53a637d4aaaed36c340a763e64d93/ss_c46cf58b44c53a637d4aaaed36c340a763e64d93.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785763768","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235160/7b0c0dd985d5baba9c1ad3f54d6cf960b5a5adc0/ss_7b0c0dd985d5baba9c1ad3f54d6cf960b5a5adc0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785763768","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235160/81a61da1695296920b9141ac0c728ab28be28578/ss_81a61da1695296920b9141ac0c728ab28be28578.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785763768"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“Trader's Life Simulator” is a first-person trading and shop management sim where you buy low, negotiate smart, and sell for profit as you build your business from the ground up.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shop Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a shop that looks good and runs efficiently. Arrange displays, organize your stock, and keep daily operations under control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235160/extras/1839ff2bb2661fca0da1066a78eb22c9.poster.avif?t=1785763768\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235160/extras/1839ff2bb2661fca0da1066a78eb22c9.webm?t=1785763768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235160/extras/1839ff2bb2661fca0da1066a78eb22c9.mp4?t=1785763768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Negotiate prices, spot worthwhile deals, and turn smart purchases into profit. Choose the right products, read the market, and sharpen your instincts as a trader.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235160/extras/24b49544a86c93976f08b59555b7fee7.poster.avif?t=1785763768\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235160/extras/24b49544a86c93976f08b59555b7fee7.webm?t=1785763768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235160/extras/24b49544a86c93976f08b59555b7fee7.mp4?t=1785763768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your profits back into the business, expand your shop, improve your skills, and adapt to changing market conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235160/extras/012007d54214f2fe057eaab2e3390518.poster.avif?t=1785763768\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235160/extras/012007d54214f2fe057eaab2e3390518.webm?t=1785763768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235160/extras/012007d54214f2fe057eaab2e3390518.mp4?t=1785763768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give your shop its own identity. Change floors, paint walls, add decorations, and shape a space that feels like yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235160/extras/2b1fe74254951d8cea9593855193fab1.poster.avif?t=1785763768\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235160/extras/2b1fe74254951d8cea9593855193fab1.webm?t=1785763768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cleaning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take out the trash, clean the floors, and keep your shop looking professional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235160/extras/96e3deb5910e61d6c0704da7ae9ffe35.poster.avif?t=1785763768\" width=1000 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235160/extras/96e3deb5910e61d6c0704da7ae9ffe35.webm?t=1785763768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235160/extras/96e3deb5910e61d6c0704da7ae9ffe35.mp4?t=1785763768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Protect</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect your business by hiring security guards or dealing with trouble yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235160/extras/50170f6525f40cf802ec449a8346420f.poster.avif?t=1785763768\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235160/extras/50170f6525f40cf802ec449a8346420f.webm?t=1785763768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4570 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 / AMD Radeon RX 560 (2 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 / AMD Radeon RX 6600 (6 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","Simulation","Early Access"],"developers":["Ronin Games"],"publishers":["Ronin Games"],"release_date":"Coming soon"}